 abdomen. Upon death, they will explode and freeze nearby Operators. Due to their low intelligence, they are easily controlled by Yeti Squadron members for various tactical purposes.","abilities":["Upon death, deals Physical damage in an area and applies Cold to affected targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":450,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.7}},"frostfang":{"slug":"frostfang","name":"Frostfang","icon":"/enemies-icons/Frostfang.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Infected Creature","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Creatures manipulated by the Yeti Squadron. Their bodies are equipped with a certain brand of monitoring equipment. Due to their speed and natural camouflage in the tundra environment, they can easily slip through our defenses and inflict massive damage. At the same time, they can inflict fatal damage to frozen Operators, and must be dealt with cautiously.","abilities":["Attack power increases when attacking Frozen targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.9,"stats":{"hp":9450,"atk":500,"def":0,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.4}},"yeti_icecleaver":{"slug":"yeti_icecleaver","name":"Yeti Icecleaver","icon":"/enemies-icons/Yeti Icecleaver.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A special melee combatant of the Yeti Squadron hailing from teams of infected gerilla warriors in the Northwestern Tundra. Grim reapers on the battlefield, they wield long katanas that can easily ravage frozen Operators, hence the nickname they've been given, 'Ice Cleaver.'","abilities":["Attack power increases greatly when attacking Frozen targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":