 artillery casters of the Ursus army. They presage the withering firepower of the Ursus Artillery.","abilities":["Flying unit."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":52000,"atk":1000,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"ursus_raider":{"slug":"ursus_raider","name":"Ursus Raider","icon":"/enemies-icons/Ursus Raider.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Special forces within the Ursus Army that strike a balance between mobility and breakthrough capabilities. Good at fighting underequipped enemy forces.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by units with at least 2 Block","Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Ursus Civilians> and <Talulah, the Fighter>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.5,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":550,"def":500,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.2}},"misery_blade_of_silence_enemy_8016_misery_3":{"slug":"misery_blade_of_silence_enemy_8016_misery_3","name":"'Misery', Blade of Silence","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Misery', Blade of Silence.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical","Arts"],"flavourText":"A Breakthrough Trainer simulating Misery at the peak of his combat prowess.\nA stealth specialist who excels in spatial Arts, he toys with the dagger in his hand as he keeps opponents distracted. Beware, he's not especially fond of being called an 'assassin'.","abilities":["100% Physical and Arts dodge when on a tile shrouded by night","[Instant Scar] Deals heavy Physical damage to the Operator with lowest Max HP; targets defeated this way have greatly increased Redeployment Time; target loses visibility if hit 3 times in a row","[Dissolution Space] When affected by Stun, Cold, Freeze, Fear, Lure, or Shifted, imm